   252	    // this seat stays keyed to an epoch the member stands outside of, so RE-SEAL each standing chunk at the
   253	    // group's current key, after the add. Absent a re-seal capability, or an empty bag, this adds nothing and the
   254	    // pre-seat chunks stay unreached, visibly (an empty `reSealed`).
   255	    for (const bagUrl of returned ? [] : (ctx.reseal ?? [])) {
